{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/d4j258fq","slide":2,"text":"Local service needs are urgent — but finding help is often uncertain.","textPreview":"Local service needs are urgent — but finding help is often uncertain.","textChars":69,"textLines":1,"bbox":[72,82,1010,62]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/c3a1w3y5","slide":2,"text":"Customers need clarity and confidence; qualified providers need a fair, efficient path to work.","textPreview":"Customers need clarity and confidence; qualified providers need a fair, efficient path to work.","textChars":95,"textLines":1,"bbox":[72,151,980,48]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/z61k7ixg","slide":2,"bbox":[72,275,16,16]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/y5sjydgb","slide":2,"text":"Discovery is fragmented","textPreview":"Discovery is fragmented","textChars":23,"textLines":1,"bbox":[72,320,300,56]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/l83298fm","slide":2,"text":"People waste time searching, comparing, and calling when the need is immediate.","textPreview":"People waste time searching, comparing, and calling when the need is immediate.","textChars":79,"textLines":1,"bbox":[72,390,300,84]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/07u103y1","slide":2,"bbox":[450,275,16,16]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/nulkbixs","slide":2,"text":"Trust is hard to verify","textPreview":"Trust is hard to verify","textChars":23,"textLines":1,"bbox":[450,320,300,56]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/m9cj2dg7","slide":2,"text":"Availability alone does not confirm the right provider, eligibility, or accountability.","textPreview":"Availability alone does not confirm the right provider, eligibility, or accountability.","textChars":87,"textLines":1,"bbox":[450,390,300,84]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/cvmpkbax","slide":2,"bbox":[828,275,16,16]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/dgvqtgbi","slide":2,"text":"Progress is invisible","textPreview":"Progress is invisible","textChars":21,"textLines":1,"bbox":[828,320,300,56]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/qt47i1s7","slide":2,"text":"Once a request is made, customers need honest updates — not uncertainty.","textPreview":"Once a request is made, customers need honest updates — not uncertainty.","textChars":72,"textLines":1,"bbox":[828,390,300,84]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/rudor6tc","slide":2,"bbox":[72,564,1136,74]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/0jmpoba9","slide":2,"text":"FixNow is designed to turn a stressful search into a guided, accountable service journey.","textPreview":"FixNow is designed to turn a stressful search into a guided, accountable service journey.","textChars":89,"textLines":1,"bbox":[100,587,1050,26]}
